WEBVTT

00:00:21.746 --> 00:00:24.516
Let's go and don't cry, funny

00:00:24.516 --> 00:00:27.452
Give me a dumbass dream, please

00:00:27.452 --> 00:00:29.688
Don't touch me, baby

00:00:29.688 --> 00:00:32.891
Freedom, baby

00:00:32.891 --> 00:00:38.797
I'm elastic, I want to be chained

00:00:38.797 --> 00:00:43.401
Can you feel it? The nonsensical afterimage

00:00:43.401 --> 00:00:55.146
Even the moments of points and lines
disappear after failing to show

00:00:55.146 --> 00:01:00.886
The sad forefront, an empty sensation

00:01:00.886 --> 00:01:06.558
Sweet remnants that tear at my heart

00:01:06.558 --> 00:01:12.230
Scattering Polaroids, gathering paranoia

00:01:12.230 --> 00:01:17.402
I want you to tell me whose turn is next

00:01:17.402 --> 00:01:30.770
If you sleep close to this incomplete
form, you'll understand and see

00:01:33.084 --> 00:01:35.987
So, has anything happened since?

00:01:35.987 --> 00:01:40.792
No attempts to contact them
from the outside have been made.

00:01:40.792 --> 00:01:44.930
I believe it's unlikely that they're spies.

00:01:44.930 --> 00:01:50.635
Yes. It looks more and more like
an act based on personal feelings.

00:01:50.635 --> 00:01:54.072
Actually, and this is only my opinion,

00:01:54.072 --> 00:01:59.210
but Wolf Gîring has
been acting unusual lately.

00:01:59.210 --> 00:02:00.578
Wolf has?

00:02:00.578 --> 00:02:03.014
He shows signs of illness,

00:02:03.014 --> 00:02:07.018
and the medical center
has diagnosed it as influenza,

00:02:07.018 --> 00:02:12.524
but I can't help but
wonder if that's truly the case.

00:02:12.524 --> 00:02:14.859
Do you suspect drug poisoning?

00:02:14.859 --> 00:02:16.661
I can't say for sure yet.

00:02:16.661 --> 00:02:23.201
But similar flu-like symptoms
have been going around the department.

00:02:23.201 --> 00:02:27.238
Very well. Continue to keep your eye on Wolf.

00:02:27.238 --> 00:02:30.976
Be certain to report
all suspicious activity to me.

00:02:30.976 --> 00:02:35.613
Understood, sir. What shall we
do with the two in confinement?

00:02:35.613 --> 00:02:38.483
Let's continue to watch and wait.

00:02:38.483 --> 00:02:42.988
More than anything, this
incident demands prudent foresight.

00:02:42.988 --> 00:02:47.125
Than shall we withhold information
about the Blassreiter's transfer?

00:02:47.125 --> 00:02:48.660
Yes, we shall.

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:50.252
Yes, sir.

00:03:02.607 --> 00:03:06.945
Things are a lot livelier
now than they used to be!

00:03:06.945 --> 00:03:12.283
Tighten Actuators 4 through 9 a bit more.

00:03:12.283 --> 00:03:16.879
I've fixed the pedals here,
so if you could just do a tune-up...

00:03:21.059 --> 00:03:23.493
Okay, I leave the rest to you.

00:03:28.733 --> 00:03:31.236
- Hey.
- Oh, hi.

00:03:31.236 --> 00:03:35.206
So, how does it feel
to tinker with the new toys?

00:03:35.206 --> 00:03:36.975
It's incredible!

00:03:36.975 --> 00:03:40.678
I guess this is the definition
of "the latest and greatest"...

00:03:40.678 --> 00:03:44.449
I think I'll be stuck staring at the
instruction manual for some time.

00:03:44.449 --> 00:03:49.187
I hear the outside is electrified
to prevent contact with Amalgams?

00:03:49.187 --> 00:03:51.790
Gotta be crazy to think up something like that!

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:56.327
But if it means a pilot can fight
without worrying about infection,

00:03:56.327 --> 00:03:58.363
then it's worth it.

00:03:58.363 --> 00:04:00.865
Yeah, huh?

00:04:00.865 --> 00:04:02.734
Captain...

00:04:02.734 --> 00:04:05.870
What powers the electrified armor?

00:04:05.870 --> 00:04:08.139
Where does it get its power?

00:04:08.139 --> 00:04:09.407
Oh, right!

00:04:09.407 --> 00:04:14.846
It runs on its own condenser,
independent of the main generator.

00:04:14.846 --> 00:04:17.282
So power output shouldn't be a problem!

00:04:17.282 --> 00:04:18.943
Good.

00:04:22.420 --> 00:04:26.157
Whoa, you alright?

00:04:26.157 --> 00:04:31.429
I've had it all morning. Seems
to be a cold. It's been going around.

00:04:31.429 --> 00:04:32.931
Try not to catch it yourself.

00:04:32.931 --> 00:04:34.032
Yeah.

00:04:34.032 --> 00:04:39.370
I hear Lene-san transferred here
from the GSG9, just like you guys.

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:42.373
Do you know each other?

00:04:42.373 --> 00:04:43.875
Yeah, sorta.

00:04:43.875 --> 00:04:49.347
Stop! If I'm such an eyesore, then just say so!

00:04:49.347 --> 00:04:52.050
I'd rather have that than be ignored!

00:04:52.050 --> 00:04:53.618
Why did you join XAT?

00:04:53.618 --> 00:04:55.320
Isn't it obvious?

00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:59.390
To confront an idiot who disappeared
without so much as a word!

00:04:59.390 --> 00:05:04.395
With a reason like that,
you'll only get yourself killed here.

00:05:04.395 --> 00:05:06.865
There's no turning back now anyway.

00:05:06.865 --> 00:05:10.235
There are no replacement
members on Squad 3 yet.

00:05:10.235 --> 00:05:14.706
Or, what, do you think you
can pilot a Paladin in my place?

00:05:14.706 --> 00:05:19.177
Even so, you don't belong here.

00:05:19.177 --> 00:05:24.809
It's different here. There's no
surviving with only two bullets left.

00:05:40.532 --> 00:05:42.300
Emergency situation!

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:44.502
106 in progress at the municipal gymnasium!

00:05:44.502 --> 00:05:48.734
All XAT personnel, stand by on Type 1 Alert!

00:05:51.776 --> 00:05:54.679
Fear not suffering.

00:05:54.679 --> 00:06:01.319
Look. To test you, the
Devil has cast one into a cell.

00:06:01.319 --> 00:06:06.124
You shall experience ten days' suffering.

00:06:06.124 --> 00:06:08.426
Be loyal to the death.

00:06:08.426 --> 00:06:14.524
Do so, and I shall grant you the crown of life.

00:06:16.367 --> 00:06:18.436
This is a clean-up operation
of unprecedented scale!

00:06:18.436 --> 00:06:21.406
It's safe to assume there are no
survivors within the sealed-off area!

00:06:21.406 --> 00:06:23.875
Treat everything as an Amalgam!

00:06:23.875 --> 00:06:25.536
- Roger!
- Roger!

00:06:30.014 --> 00:06:36.054
Bravo Team, operation
complete. 15 killed, 3 wounded...

00:06:36.054 --> 00:06:37.783
Any rounds left?

00:06:41.059 --> 00:06:43.595
Only one left...

00:06:43.595 --> 00:06:45.063
Same here.

00:06:45.063 --> 00:06:48.555
We'd be goners now if
either of us had shot any more.

00:06:51.769 --> 00:06:55.967
This is my good luck. You can have it, newbie.

00:07:03.314 --> 00:07:06.875
In that case, you can have my good fortune.

00:07:10.421 --> 00:07:13.049
I'll accept it gratefully.

00:07:35.179 --> 00:07:38.283
Will Squad 3 really be enough by itself?

00:07:38.283 --> 00:07:42.787
All the other squads
have too many ill members,

00:07:42.787 --> 00:07:45.423
and as we're trying to prevent
the illness from spreading,

00:07:45.423 --> 00:07:48.359
mobilizing all members at
this stage would be dangerous.

00:07:48.359 --> 00:07:51.095
Let's leave this to the Paladin unit.

00:07:51.095 --> 00:07:54.232
Where are Hermann
and Amanda during all this?!

00:07:54.232 --> 00:07:59.304
They are presently incarcerated
for leaking information.

00:07:59.304 --> 00:08:02.899
It may be quite difficult
to bring them back now...

00:08:07.378 --> 00:08:09.814
W-What is this?!

00:08:09.814 --> 00:08:12.650
Mei-Fong! Where are Hermann and Amanda?!

00:08:12.650 --> 00:08:13.651
I-I'm sorry, but...!

00:08:13.651 --> 00:08:18.520
Can't you see this is no time for that?!

00:08:22.160 --> 00:08:25.129
Shit! What the hell's going on?!

00:08:25.129 --> 00:08:28.700
How long are you gonna keep us in this place?!

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:30.031
What's going on?

00:08:43.214 --> 00:08:47.685
Wolf, we'll have everything
cleaned up momentarily.

00:08:47.685 --> 00:08:50.620
Just to be safe, send supplies and backup!

00:08:52.690 --> 00:08:54.351
What?

00:09:06.104 --> 00:09:08.197
A-An Amalgam!

00:09:19.884 --> 00:09:21.219
Yo.

00:09:21.219 --> 00:09:23.621
Enjoy your time off?

00:09:23.621 --> 00:09:24.815
Al!

00:09:32.563 --> 00:09:34.265
What the hell's going on?!

00:09:34.265 --> 00:09:37.462
That's what we'd like to know.

00:09:42.840 --> 00:09:44.398
Come on!

00:09:54.419 --> 00:09:57.422
What does this mean? People in
the department have been infected?!

00:09:57.422 --> 00:10:00.658
Apparently so. The west ward is in ruins now.

00:10:00.658 --> 00:10:02.827
It's only a matter of time for this place, too.

00:10:02.827 --> 00:10:04.262
Don't tell me it was Blue...!

00:10:04.262 --> 00:10:08.599
If it was, you guys'd be
the most likely to be infected...

00:10:08.599 --> 00:10:11.102
We've secured Amanda and Hermann.

00:10:11.102 --> 00:10:12.937
How are things on your end, Mei-Fong?

00:10:12.937 --> 00:10:14.872
I've prepared an escape helicopter.

00:10:14.872 --> 00:10:17.108
I've also secured the
department's comms network.

00:10:17.108 --> 00:10:18.676
Leave all the guiding to me.

00:10:18.676 --> 00:10:21.579
Are there any other
survivors in the department?

00:10:21.579 --> 00:10:24.816
Squad 1 members are
under siege in the arms depot.

00:10:24.816 --> 00:10:29.253
Captain Wolf is on his way there,
so please meet up with him.

00:10:29.253 --> 00:10:30.822
Got it!

00:10:30.822 --> 00:10:33.825
What about Blue?
What's the situation at the lab?

00:10:33.825 --> 00:10:37.028
The circuits to the
research ward have been cut,

00:10:37.028 --> 00:10:39.363
so I can't ascertain the situation.

00:10:39.363 --> 00:10:40.998
It's too dangerous to approach now.

00:10:40.998 --> 00:10:43.968
W-Wait! What about Malek?!

00:10:43.968 --> 00:10:46.971
What's going to happen to
the infected people in quarantine?!

00:10:46.971 --> 00:10:54.078
Your brother was relocated this
morning. I can guarantee his safety.

00:10:54.078 --> 00:10:57.615
Hey! Hold on, Mei-Fong!
What are you talking about?!

00:10:57.615 --> 00:11:01.886
Don't tell me he's been made
part of some deal instead of Blue!

00:11:01.886 --> 00:11:04.722
Mei-Fong! Tell me! What is a Blassreiter?!

00:11:04.722 --> 00:11:08.960
Where did the chief take Malek?!

00:11:08.960 --> 00:11:12.897
Amanda... Please understand the situation.

00:11:12.897 --> 00:11:16.634
Because of your selfishness,
the entire team is now in grave danger!

00:11:16.634 --> 00:11:20.638
Do you know how much risk
Al and Brad put themselves in

00:11:20.638 --> 00:11:24.074
to rescue you two from your detention cells?

00:11:25.109 --> 00:11:26.077
Amanda...

00:11:26.077 --> 00:11:31.649
I know how you feel, but your
first priority is to make it out alive.

00:11:31.649 --> 00:11:37.321
If you die now, you won't
be able to get Malek back.

00:11:37.321 --> 00:11:39.312
Alright...

00:11:51.536 --> 00:11:54.805
You're finally awake? How pathetic...

00:11:54.805 --> 00:11:56.207
Where am I?

00:11:56.207 --> 00:11:58.109
Smack-dab in enemy territory.

00:11:58.109 --> 00:12:01.779
I would've let you sleep anyway,

00:12:01.779 --> 00:12:06.375
but apparently some
unsightly pests have snuck inside.

00:12:10.721 --> 00:12:12.223
Operation complete!

00:12:12.223 --> 00:12:16.827
Keep your eyes peeled! There could
be survivors still lurking around!

00:12:16.827 --> 00:12:18.896
Roger!

00:12:18.896 --> 00:12:22.600
And Clavier! I'm concerned
about the comms breakdown with HQ!

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:25.236
Go back and check what's happening!

00:12:25.236 --> 00:12:26.938
Yes, sir! But...

00:12:26.938 --> 00:12:29.373
Four units here will be enough!

00:12:29.373 --> 00:12:31.976
Senger! Go with Clavier as escort!

00:12:31.976 --> 00:12:33.534
Understood, sir!

00:12:40.318 --> 00:12:42.253
All units, check your ammo!

00:12:42.253 --> 00:12:45.957
We won't get more supplies
until she gets back! Use caution!

00:12:45.957 --> 00:12:47.549
Captain! Look!

00:12:56.167 --> 00:12:57.835
Paladins, huh?

00:12:57.835 --> 00:13:02.406
HQ! Please respond! Is anyone there?!

00:13:02.406 --> 00:13:04.609
What the hell's happened?!

00:13:04.609 --> 00:13:08.773
I don't know. We'll just have to go and look.

00:13:10.514 --> 00:13:14.118
Careful. I have a bad feeling about this.

00:13:14.118 --> 00:13:18.020
Yeah. It's almost too quiet.

00:13:29.333 --> 00:13:31.902
- Damn!
- What the hell?!

00:13:31.902 --> 00:13:34.427
They were waiting for us?!

00:13:42.713 --> 00:13:43.981
Blue?!

00:13:43.981 --> 00:13:47.818
Damn! He's escaped from the lab!

00:13:47.818 --> 00:13:49.687
Don't shoot, Senger!

00:13:49.687 --> 00:13:52.781
He's leading the enemy away...

00:13:57.995 --> 00:14:02.261
You gotta be kidding me!
Aren't they all Amalgams?!

00:14:03.367 --> 00:14:06.063
Hey! Are we just going to let him go?!

00:14:06.937 --> 00:14:10.341
Checking on HQ comes first!

00:14:10.341 --> 00:14:13.811
We wouldn't stand a chance
with our low ammo stores, anyway.

00:14:13.811 --> 00:14:15.846
Roger.

00:14:15.846 --> 00:14:21.352
I dunno what you're up to,
but for now I thank you.

00:14:21.352 --> 00:14:26.483
How unbelievably unbeautiful.
Do you suppose this city is done for?

00:14:27.992 --> 00:14:31.462
It's not too late yet, if we can
stop whoever's controlling them!

00:14:31.462 --> 00:14:35.966
Given this level of disturbance,
they must be nearby!

00:14:35.966 --> 00:14:39.299
We have to stop them
while XAT can still hold out!

00:14:56.821 --> 00:14:58.789
It's been a while...

00:15:02.326 --> 00:15:03.816
...Joseph.

00:15:05.930 --> 00:15:07.732
Beatrice...

00:15:07.732 --> 00:15:12.303
How pathetic, being
captured by the likes of XAT.

00:15:12.303 --> 00:15:16.407
I had to go to this much
trouble to break you out.

00:15:16.407 --> 00:15:18.542
You could show some appreciation...

00:15:18.542 --> 00:15:20.644
This city is finished.

00:15:20.644 --> 00:15:22.947
Once XAT is wiped out,

00:15:22.947 --> 00:15:26.817
not even an army can
stand against our apostles.

00:15:26.817 --> 00:15:32.089
At this point, "they" will have
to actually get involved themselves.

00:15:32.089 --> 00:15:36.827
It's time to end this
comedic drama known as XAT

00:15:36.827 --> 00:15:41.632
and have our true enemy take center stage.

00:15:41.632 --> 00:15:43.701
Where is Xargin?!

00:15:43.701 --> 00:15:46.003
Why do you want to know?

00:15:46.003 --> 00:15:47.037
Do you want to crawl...

00:15:47.037 --> 00:15:48.572
Answer me!

00:15:48.572 --> 00:15:50.207
Foolish man.

00:15:50.207 --> 00:15:53.177
Don't you realize that the more we fight,

00:15:53.177 --> 00:15:57.915
the more things go as they want?

00:15:57.915 --> 00:16:02.820
Oh, you do know? That makes
you all the more foolish, then.

00:16:02.820 --> 00:16:08.793
Still... that foolishness may be
exactly what Xargin-sama seeks.

00:16:08.793 --> 00:16:11.395
Fine. I'll test you.

00:16:11.395 --> 00:16:16.162
To see if you truly are worthy
of standing before Xargin-sama!

00:16:24.708 --> 00:16:28.779
Don't shoot! We're friendlies!

00:16:28.779 --> 00:16:31.916
These are the only survivors?

00:16:31.916 --> 00:16:34.318
Hey, are you okay?

00:16:34.318 --> 00:16:36.287
It's nothin'.

00:16:36.287 --> 00:16:38.656
It's finally time to strike back!

00:16:38.656 --> 00:16:40.558
Where's Captain Wolf?

00:16:40.558 --> 00:16:42.760
I don't know. He's not here.

00:16:42.760 --> 00:16:45.696
He headed here before we did.

00:16:45.696 --> 00:16:49.400
Mei-Fong! Can you locate the captain?

00:16:49.400 --> 00:16:53.837
I'm sorry. I don't know where
he went. He wandered off-course.

00:16:56.841 --> 00:16:59.643
Guess we better say our prayers, too...

00:16:59.643 --> 00:17:02.179
We can't just give up now!

00:17:02.179 --> 00:17:06.750
That would be pointless struggling, Hermann.

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:11.322
You're trapped like rats.
You have nowhere to run now.

00:17:11.322 --> 00:17:16.460
Actually, neither do I. No one can escape now.

00:17:16.460 --> 00:17:20.531
That goes for all life on this planet, even.

00:17:20.531 --> 00:17:22.933
What the hell is going on?!

00:17:22.933 --> 00:17:26.937
But I will praise you for fighting this far.

00:17:26.937 --> 00:17:32.376
As elite XAT members, you're
indeed as skilled as I had believed.

00:17:32.376 --> 00:17:36.113
This was all your doing?!

00:17:36.113 --> 00:17:37.982
You're strong.

00:17:37.982 --> 00:17:42.586
A new era is coming. One in
which only strength like yours matters.

00:17:42.586 --> 00:17:45.122
An era for us.

00:17:45.122 --> 00:17:47.091
Have you gone insane, Captain?!

00:17:47.091 --> 00:17:51.028
On the contrary. I'm trying to help you.

00:17:51.028 --> 00:17:55.432
I'm going to take you from
this crumbling world to a new one!

00:17:55.432 --> 00:17:56.934
What?!

00:17:56.934 --> 00:18:01.005
Listen, Al. We're friends, right?

00:18:01.005 --> 00:18:04.742
Together, we've cheated
death countless times.

00:18:04.742 --> 00:18:07.945
We've fought for each other's lives.

00:18:07.945 --> 00:18:10.748
Even if I fight for a living like this forever,

00:18:10.748 --> 00:18:14.551
I'll never find better comrades than all of you.

00:18:14.551 --> 00:18:18.756
So you want us all to turn
into some monsters for you?!

00:18:18.756 --> 00:18:21.759
Just for your stupid fantasy?!

00:18:21.759 --> 00:18:27.197
I don't blame you for resisting.
It was hard for me at first, too.

00:18:27.197 --> 00:18:30.267
But it's really not that
bad once you get used to it.

00:18:30.267 --> 00:18:34.271
In fact, it's wonderful,
having a superhuman body.

00:18:34.271 --> 00:18:37.274
Screw you and this selfish crap of yours!

00:18:37.274 --> 00:18:41.445
Friends, my ass! All you're doing
is screwing even more people over!

00:18:41.445 --> 00:18:44.114
The era of humanity is about to end.

00:18:44.114 --> 00:18:49.620
So isn't it human nature to
want those close to you to survive?

00:18:49.620 --> 00:18:51.822
This is insane...

00:18:51.822 --> 00:18:56.460
Follow my lead. It's not too late yet.

00:18:56.460 --> 00:19:00.898
Let me give you bodies
to survive the Last Judgment.

00:19:00.898 --> 00:19:02.433
Wolf...

00:19:02.433 --> 00:19:05.402
You're nothing like Gerd and Malek.

00:19:05.402 --> 00:19:09.373
No, you're the very definition of a monster!

00:19:09.373 --> 00:19:12.176
Is that your answer?

00:19:12.176 --> 00:19:16.313
Yeah. We ain't gonna be monsters with you.

00:19:16.313 --> 00:19:18.349
If we're gonna die with you,

00:19:18.349 --> 00:19:21.250
then it'll be when we're
fighting you while still human!

00:19:26.924 --> 00:19:28.792
That's hilarious!

00:19:28.792 --> 00:19:32.830
"While still human," huh?
Funny you should say that...

00:19:32.830 --> 00:19:34.491
Shut up!

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:41.335
No matter. I'm sure you'll
change your minds soon enough.

00:19:50.147 --> 00:19:54.607
Now! Let the Apocalypse begin!

00:19:55.953 --> 00:19:59.089
That is the current XAT situation.

00:19:59.089 --> 00:20:05.362
Given the level of damage,
its continued existence is beyond all hope.

00:20:05.362 --> 00:20:10.100
I see. To think that Wolf
had been taken in like this...

00:20:10.100 --> 00:20:11.368
Damn you, Xargin.

00:20:11.368 --> 00:20:15.639
You've used unexpected methods
to really push the clock forward...

00:20:15.639 --> 00:20:18.675
What shall we do, sir?

00:20:18.675 --> 00:20:20.444
The time is nigh.

00:20:20.444 --> 00:20:25.115
For now, let us buy time until
the Three Knights are assembled.

00:20:25.115 --> 00:20:30.320
It could be argued that XAT
has now fulfilled its purpose.

00:20:30.320 --> 00:20:31.622
Then...?

00:20:31.622 --> 00:20:35.826
Yes. Return to your unit, Mei-Fong.

00:20:35.826 --> 00:20:41.799
Your knight has already been
sent there. It should arrive shortly.

00:20:41.799 --> 00:20:43.391
Understood, sir.

00:20:44.568 --> 00:20:48.405
What's wrong? Why so timid?

00:20:48.405 --> 00:20:51.932
Can't fight for real against an unarmed girl?

00:20:53.544 --> 00:20:58.709
It's fine to act tough and all,
but your confidence betrays you.

00:21:02.753 --> 00:21:05.656
Transform, Joseph.

00:21:05.656 --> 00:21:11.253
I won't let up until you get serious, you know.

00:21:14.431 --> 00:21:19.391
Excellent. Now you're worth beating senseless.

00:21:47.064 --> 00:21:54.938
The ever-flowing songs search my memory

00:21:54.938 --> 00:22:07.050
The pain etched out by the
times slowly brings me back

00:22:07.050 --> 00:22:10.287
Embrace the sadness

00:22:10.287 --> 00:22:17.728
I know, the days that have passed by

00:22:17.728 --> 00:22:22.232
When I look up, it doesn't spill down

00:22:22.232 --> 00:22:28.805
As it trickles down the window,
sad rain rattles the heated isolation

00:22:28.805 --> 00:22:34.178
Tonight I will be forsaken by sleep

00:22:34.178 --> 00:22:41.985
It's almost as if I'm traveling
to a country no one's ever heard of

00:22:41.985 --> 00:22:48.325
I'm all alone, and my words
don't get through to anyone

00:22:48.325 --> 00:22:50.394
Wow wow

00:22:50.394 --> 00:22:58.402
Now my heart is frozen and waiting

00:22:58.402 --> 00:23:05.501
because it wants a phone
call so it can connect with you

00:23:13.283 --> 00:23:17.154
Pain. Friends being eaten away at.

00:23:17.154 --> 00:23:22.226
Yet, even at the depths of despair,
the knights uphold their honor.

00:23:22.226 --> 00:23:25.996
Episode 12: "Judgment Day."

00:23:25.996 --> 00:23:30.194
As long as one is kept safe
through it all, death matters not.
